msgstr "Instalação do NSS"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>NSS</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>NSS</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:183
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../nss-standalone-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cd nss &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"make BUILD_OPT=1                      \\\n"
"  NSPR_INCLUDE_DIR=/usr/include/nspr  \\\n"
"  USE_SYSTEM_ZLIB=1                   \\\n"
"  ZLIB_LIBS=-lz                       \\\n"
"  NSS_ENABLE_WERROR=0                 \\\n"
"  NSS_USE_SYSTEM_SQLITE=1             \\\n"
"  $([ $(uname -m) = x86_64 ] &amp;&amp; echo USE_64=1)</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../nss-standalone-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cd nss &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"make BUILD_OPT=1                      \\\n"
"  NSPR_INCLUDE_DIR=/usr/include/nspr  \\\n"
"  USE_SYSTEM_ZLIB=1                   \\\n"
"  ZLIB_LIBS=-lz                       \\\n"
"  NSS_ENABLE_WERROR=0                 \\\n"
"  NSS_USE_SYSTEM_SQLITE=1             \\\n"
"  $([ $(uname -m) = x86_64 ] &amp;&amp; echo USE_64=1)</userinput>"

#.  the unittest files get compiled automatically since nss-3.31.0
#. (1 test is known to fail)
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:197
#, xml-text
msgid "To run the tests, execute the following commands:"
msgstr "Para executar os testes, execute os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:200
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cd tests &amp;&amp;\n"
"HOST=localhost DOMSUF=localdomain ./all.sh\n"
"cd ../</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cd tests &amp;&amp;\n"
"HOST=localhost DOMSUF=localdomain ./all.sh\n"
"cd ../</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:205
#, xml-text
msgid "Some information about the tests:"
msgstr "Alguma informação relativa aos testes:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:209
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"HOST=localhost and DOMSUF=localdomain are required.  Without these "
"variables, a FQDN is required to be specified and this generic way should "
"work for everyone, provided <systemitem>localhost.localdomain</systemitem> "
"is defined <phrase revision='sysv'> in <filename>/etc/hosts</filename>, as "
"done in <ulink url=\"&lfs-root;/chapter09/network.html#ch-config-hosts\"> "
"the LFS book</ulink>.  </phrase> <phrase revision='systemd'> by the "
"<systemitem class='library'>myhostname</systemitem> Name Service Switch "
"module, as specified in <ulink url=\"&lfs-root;/chapter08/glibc.html#conf-"
"glibc\"> the LFS book</ulink>.  </phrase>"
msgstr ""
"HOST=localhost e DOMSUF=localdomain são exigidas. Sem essas variáveis, um "
"FQDN é exigido que seja especificado e essa forma genérica deveria funcionar"
" para todos(as), desde que <systemitem>localhost.localdomain</systemitem> "
"esteja definido <phrase revision='sysv'>em <filename>/etc/hosts</filename>, "
"conforme feito <ulink url=\"&lfs-root;/chapter09/network.html#ch-config-"
"hosts\">no livro LFS</ulink>. </phrase> <phrase revision='systemd'>pelo "
"módulo Name Service Switch da <systemitem "
"class='library'>myhostname</systemitem>, conforme especificado <ulink "
"url=\"&lfs-root;/chapter08/glibc.html#conf-glibc\">no livro LFS</ulink>. "
"</phrase>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:229
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The tests take a long time to run. If desired there is information in the "
"all.sh script about running subsets of the total test suite."
msgstr ""
"Os testes tomam um tempo longo para executar. Se desejado, existe informação"
" no conjunto de comandos sequenciais all.sh relativa a executar subconjuntos"
" da suíte total de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:236
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"When interrupting the tests, the test suite fails to spin down test servers "
"that are run. This leads to an infinite loop in the tests where the test "
"suite tries to kill a server that doesn't exist anymore because it pulls the"
" wrong PID."
msgstr ""
"Ao interromper os testes, a suíte de teste falha ao desligar os servidores "
"de teste que estão executando. Isso leva a um loop infinito nos testes em "
"que a suíte de teste tenta matar um servidor que não mais existe porque "
"extrai o PID errado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:244
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Test suite results (in HTML format!) can be found at "
"../../test_results/security/localhost.1/results.html"
msgstr ""
"Os resultados da suíte de teste (em formato HTML!) podem ser encontrados em "
"../../test_results/security/localhost.1/results.html"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:250
#, xml-text
msgid "A few tests might fail on some Intel machines for unknown reasons."
msgstr ""
"Uns poucos testes podem falhar em algumas máquinas Intel por razões "
"desconhecidas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:257
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:260
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cd ../dist                                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m755 Linux*/lib/*.so  /usr/lib         &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 Linux*/lib/*.chk /usr/lib         &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m755 -d               /usr/include/nss &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -v -RL {public,private}/nss/*  /usr/include/nss &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m755 Linux*/bin/{certutil,nss-config,pk12util} /usr/bin &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m644 Linux*/lib/pkgconfig/nss.pc  /usr/lib/pkgconfig</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cd ../dist                                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m755 Linux*/lib/*.so  /usr/lib         &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 Linux*/lib/*.chk /usr/lib         &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m755 -d               /usr/include/nss &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -v -RL {public,private}/nss/*  /usr/include/nss &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m755 Linux*/bin/{certutil,nss-config,pk12util} /usr/bin &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m644 Linux*/lib/pkgconfig/nss.pc  /usr/lib/pkgconfig</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:275
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:278
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>BUILD_OPT=1</parameter>: This option is passed to "
"<command>make</command> so that the build is performed with no debugging "
"symbols built into the binaries and the default compiler optimizations are "
"used."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>BUILD_OPT=1</parameter>: Essa opção é passada para "
"<command>make</command> de modo que a construção seja realizada sem símbolos"
" de depuração embutidos nos binários e as otimizações padrão do compilador "
"sejam usadas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:285
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>NSPR_INCLUDE_DIR=/usr/include/nspr</parameter>: This option sets "
"the location of the nspr headers."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>NSPR_INCLUDE_DIR=/usr/include/nspr</parameter>: Essa opção "
"configura o local dos cabeçalhos nspr."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:290
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>USE_SYSTEM_ZLIB=1</parameter>: This option is passed to "
"<command>make</command> to ensure that the <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libssl3.so</filename> library is linked to the system "
"installed <application>zlib</application> instead of the in-tree version."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>USE_SYSTEM_ZLIB=1</parameter>: Essa opção é passada para "
"<command>make</command> para garantir que a biblioteca <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libssl3.so</filename> esteja vinculada ao "
"<application>zlib</application> instalado do sistema em vez da versão em "
"árvore."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:298
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>ZLIB_LIBS=-lz</parameter>: This option provides the linker flags "
"needed to link to the system <application>zlib</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>ZLIB_LIBS=-lz</parameter>: Essa opção fornece os sinalizadores de"
" vinculador necessários para vincular ao <application>zlib</application> do "
"sistema."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:303
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>$([ $(uname -m) = x86_64 ] &amp;&amp; echo USE_64=1)</command>: The"
" <parameter>USE_64=1</parameter> option is <emphasis>required on "
"x86_64</emphasis>, otherwise <command>make</command> will try (and fail)  to"
" create 32-bit objects. The [ $(uname -m) = x86_64 ] test ensures it has no "
"effect on a 32 bit system."
msgstr ""
"<command>$([ $(uname -m) = x86_64 ] &amp;&amp; echo USE_64=1)</command>: A "
"opção <parameter>USE_64=1</parameter> é <emphasis>exigida em "
"x86_64</emphasis>, caso contrário, <command>make</command> tentará (e "
"falhará) criar objetos de 32 bits. O teste [ $(uname -m) = x86_64 ] garante "
"que não tenha efeito em um sistema de 32 bits."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:323
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>NSS_DISABLE_GTESTS=1</option>: If you don't need to run NSS test "
"suite, append this option to <command>make</command> command, to prevent the"
" compilation of tests and save some build time."
msgstr ""
"<option>NSS_DISABLE_GTESTS=1</option>: Se você não precisa executar a suíte "
"de teste NSS, anexe essa opção ao comando <command>make</command>, para "
"evitar a compilação dos testes e economizar algum tempo de construção."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:331
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring NSS"
msgstr "Configurando NSS"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:334
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <xref linkend=\"p11-kit\"/> is installed, the "
"<application>p11-kit</application> trust module "
"(<filename>/usr/lib/pkcs11/p11-kit-trust.so</filename>) can be used as a "
"drop-in replacement for <filename>/usr/lib/libnssckbi.so</filename> to "
"transparently make the system CAs available to "
"<application>NSS</application> aware applications, rather than the static "
"library provided by <filename>/usr/lib/libnssckbi.so</filename>. As the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, execute the following"
" command:"
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend=\"p11-kit\"/> estiver instalado, o módulo de confiança do "
"<application>p11-kit</application> (<filename>/usr/lib/pkcs11/p11-kit-"
"trust.so</filename>) pode ser usado como um substituto imediato para "
"<filename>/usr/lib/libnssckbi.so</filename> para transparentemente tornar as"
" ACs do sistema disponíveis para aplicativos cientes de "
"<application>NSS</application>, em vez da biblioteca estática fornecida por "
"<filename>/usr/lib/libnssckbi.so</filename>. Como o(a) usuário(a) "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, execute o seguinte "
"comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:345
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ln -sfv ./pkcs11/p11-kit-trust.so "
"/usr/lib/libnssckbi.so</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ln -sfv ./pkcs11/p11-kit-trust.so "
"/usr/lib/libnssckbi.so</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/nss.xml:348
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Additionally, for dependent applications that do not use the internal "
"database (<filename>/usr/lib/libnssckbi.so</filename>), the "
"<filename>/usr/sbin/make-ca</filename> script included on the <xref "
"linkend=\"make-ca\"/> page can generate a system wide NSS DB with the "
"<parameter>-n</parameter> switch, or by modifying the <filename>/etc/make-"
"ca/make-ca.conf</filename> file."
msgstr ""
"Além disso, para aplicativos dependentes que não usam a base de dados "
"interna (<filename>/usr/lib/libnssckbi.so</filename>), o script "
"<filename>/usr/sbin/make-ca</filename> incluído na página <xref "
"linkend=\"make-ca\"/> pode gerar uma base de dados NSS abrangente ao sistema"
" com a chave <parameter>-n</parameter> ou modificando o arquivo "
"<filename>/etc/make-ca/make-ca. conf</filename>."

